Iceberg Lab

This project includes adaptations of two files from iancmoritz/apacheprojects:
https://github.com/iancmoritz/apacheprojects
- iceberg/python/iceberg_wasm/shims.py -> public/python/shims.py
- iceberg/scripts/build-runtime.mjs -> scripts/build-runtime.mjs

The upstream files carry Apache Software Foundation Apache-2.0 license headers.
